{"14569f2f-f66a-4c67-ac7f-a37823a0fa23":{"id":"14569f2f-f66a-4c67-ac7f-a37823a0fa23","title":"Agyeogui Ending Jugeumppun","altTitle":"Death Is the Only Ending for the Villain","description":"Penelope Eckart adalah tokoh antagonis dalam game dating simulation Princess Love Love Project yang akhir-akhir ini terkenal. Di setiap akhir cerita mode normal, tokoh Penelope selalu berakhir dengan kematian di tangan satu dari 5 tokoh pria. Tiba-tiba saja, seorang gadis Korea masuk ke dalam game itu sebagai Penelope Eckart, anak angkat keluarga Duke yang dibenci dan direndahkan semua orang. Dari pengetahuannya di masa lalu, Penelope tahu bahwa ia akan mati dengan mudah jika ia tidak segera mendapatkan hati dari salah satu tokoh pria. Sayangnya, semua tokoh itu adalah orang yang membenci Penelope dan akan membunuhnya jika dia salah langkah. Pilihannya pun terbatas pada Derrick Eckart si kakak angkat yang dingin, Reynold Eckart si kakak angkat yang sering menghina Penelope, Vinter Berdandi si Marquess yang memiliki banyak rahasia, Iklies si budak yang memiliki kemampuan pedang, atau Callisto Regulus si putra mahkota yang menganggap nyawa orang lain sebagai debu. Reputasi Penelope yang buruk dan status di rumahnya sebagai anak angkat yang diabaikan membuat perjalanan hidupnya makin sulit. Mampukan Penelope mengubah pandangan orang terhadapnya dan bertahan hidup?\n\n---\n**Original Novel:** [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52654302), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5039321), [RidiBooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/777070260)\n\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%85%EC%97%AD%EC%9D%98-%EC%97%94%EB%94%A9%EC%9D%80-%EC%A3%BD%EC%9D%8C%EB%BF%90/2383), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/54845189)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* English: [KManhwa](https://kmanhwa.com/comics-online/the-villains-ending-is-death/), [Radish](https://radishfiction.com/stories/17108), [Tapas](https://tapas.io/series/villains-are-destined-to-die/info), [Tappytoon](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/villains-are-destined-to-die)\n*Tappytoon and Radish are using the Tapas localization.*\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/8141/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E5%8F%8D%E6%B4%BE%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E7%B5%90%E5%B1%80/41)\n* [French / Français](https://www.delitoon.com/detail/daf_0000358)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Kematian-adalah-Akhir-Sang-Antagonis/23)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/53075)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%87%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%97%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%99/47)","year":2020,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"214","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/14569f2f-f66a-4c67-ac7f-a37823a0fa23/622ee7fa-b3fc-423d-85ad-7ecfaea85bef.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["pt-br","es-la","ru","th","id","tr","en","pl","uk","de","cs","bn","es","hi","it"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":9.3,"follows":102193,"listAt":"2026-10-23T01:07:56.328Z","chapters":[{"id":"0f01d260-fc5f-4f32-8be0-2b82e5ebecb6","number":"64","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":18,"createdAt":"2021-07-14T11:14:35+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:26:54.405Z"},"39e55355-dfb4-44e9-bd0b-df1fc3a0e33e":{"id":"39e55355-dfb4-44e9-bd0b-df1fc3a0e33e","title":"Geunyeo ga Gongjagjeo lo Gaya Haessdeon Sajeong","altTitle":"The Duke’s Fiancée","description":"Poisoned to death by her own betrothed?! Eunha didn’t wake up in a novel’s story just to get killed off again as an unfortunate extra! To change her story she needs a cover… 6 months pretending to be the fake fiancée of the novel's male protagonist, Duke Noah Wynknight. But will this cold-hearted, angel-faced demon of a man really help her avoid another ill-fated ending?!","year":2017,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"158","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Isekai","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/39e55355-dfb4-44e9-bd0b-df1fc3a0e33e/c6933fbb-e69b-492e-b3f9-ec722d7dc8ff.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["es-la","pt-br","ru","es","id","hu","cs","en","tr","pl","tl"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":9.15,"follows":65731,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:22.880Z","chapters":[{"id":"387f26cb-a6eb-4fbe-b1ea-e4dcd20f2db1","number":"150","volume":"5","title":"side story 3","lang":"en","pages":12,"createdAt":"2021-02-18T04:52:08+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6aeecffc-2d64-43e8-aeec-7a3df25d64ee","number":"149","volume":"5","title":"side story 2","lang":"en","pages":11,"createdAt":"2021-02-09T08:02:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b943a925-b47b-4be6-8a1e-27f76e7a80eb","number":"148","volume":"5","title":"side story 1","lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2021-02-05T06:57:41+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2a985d8a-1d9c-4c31-b6c6-eab2861f587a","number":"147","volume":"4","title":"End of main story","lang":"en","pages":8,"createdAt":"2021-02-01T07:18:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"15a47c0e-c073-420b-8143-f646fd9e9805","number":"146","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2021-01-30T23:34:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bcc0df60-d6b2-4754-8729-edc84be2713a","number":"145","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":11,"createdAt":"2021-01-25T23:29:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d431f6e1-6fd2-4ebf-a614-151d54630f3f","number":"144","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2021-01-24T02:13:56+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"800f1e84-c0c5-4e65-878a-8d9e442fb30d","number":"143","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2021-01-