, Leah decided to find a political marriage partner to retain her family’s position. However, something that starts as a mere political trick turns out to be fate!","year":2019,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"155","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4e7a7758-40a9-47e6-9b0c-2acb2804900c/60733ff0-b491-4511-9fdc-976200d50f79.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","fr","pt-br","ar"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":9.28,"follows":26158,"listAt":"2026-10-23T01:07:56.328Z","chapters":[{"id":"cad1c294-0401-4f70-95e9-a283c7496ac1","number":"67","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2021-07-20T05:45:08+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"29bc4df3-64fc-4fab-8ccc-19fa31041c9a","number":"66","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":38,"createdAt":"2021-07-20T05:38:10+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b313e790-1600-4f14-8d8b-00d88d2202f3","number":"65","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2021-07-20T05:34:50+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"cdf1a695-5f68-4d12-8f16-26ab051cbf53","number":"64","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2021-03-15T21:02:19+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"75adfe19-70a5-473a-8dc5-eeb7937e6483","number":"63","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2021-03-06T04:17:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ef14cee8-029f-4564-8a62-629b4dc5e569","number":"62","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":18,"createdAt":"2021-03-02T16:35:15+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6cd06251-88e4-41ba-a48d-5bb867452557","number":"61","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2021-02-19T14:24:51+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bd58a37f-c54e-44c3-aa53-f43bf3537e87","number":"60","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":21,"createdAt":"2021-02-18T23:31:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"da1e4e29-9124-440e-b978-4d77e6d5d18b","number":"59","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pa